WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.814
Eddy was with his friends.

2
00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:22.671
They were driving in the woods.

3
00:00:22.672 --> 00:00:28.817
"This is fun!" Poppy said.

4
00:00:28.817 --> 00:00:37.782
The road left the woods.

5
00:00:37.782 --> 00:00:40.748
The friends stopped.

6
00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:50.064
They saw piles.

7
00:00:50.065 --> 00:00:53.568
Old wheels sat in one pile.

8
00:00:53.569 --> 00:00:57.353
Another pile had car doors.

9
00:00:57.354 --> 00:01:01.817
Everything was rusty.

10
00:01:01.818 --> 00:01:05.524
"This is a junkyard," Jeb said.

11
00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:08.595
"It's a place for old parts."

12
00:01:08.596 --> 00:01:12.043
"It's creepy," Dipper said.

13
00:01:12.044 --> 00:01:15.424
"It's not creepy," Jeb said.

14
00:01:15.424 --> 00:01:18.077
"Let's look around."

15
00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.864
Jeb rolled off.

16
00:01:20.865 --> 00:01:26.753
Eddy, Poppy, and Dipper followed.

17
00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:34.799
They went past some big pipes.

18
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:38.049
Dipper drove through an oil puddle.

19
00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:40.776
"Yuck," she said.

20
00:01:40.777 --> 00:01:45.765
"Let's leave," Dipper said.

21
00:01:45.766 --> 00:01:48.317
"There might be monsters."

22
00:01:48.318 --> 00:01:51.582
"Don't be silly," Poppy said.

23
00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:54.608
"There aren't monsters," Eddy said.

24
00:01:54.608 --> 00:01:58.001
Brumm, brumm!

25
00:01:58.002 --> 00:02:03.825
Suddenly they heard a loud sound.

